        "pull_request": { "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/agent/pulls/321", "html_url": "https://github.com/link-assistant/agent/pull/321", "diff_url": "https://github.com/link-assistant/agent/pull/321.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/link-assistant/agent/pull/321.patch", "merged_at": "2026-09-29T17:48:01Z" },
        "body": "Fixes #319.\n\n## Summary\n\n- Update all unblocked JavaScript and Rust direct dependencies to their current releases, including `ai` 7, the AI SDK providers, `command-stream` 1.3, `lino-objects-codec` 0.8, and `lino-arguments` 0.3. Refresh both JavaScript lockfiles and `Cargo.lock`.\n- Add a daily and pull request dependency freshness workflow. It runs `npm outdated` and `cargo outdated --root-deps-only --exit-code 1`; the npm check accepts a pin only while its linked GitHub issue is open.\n- Add a patch changeset and Rust changelog fragment so the release workflows publish the updated packages after merge. Hive Mind's Agent pin is tracked by [hive-mind#2324](https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/2324) R1 and can move after the npm release.\n\n## AI SDK 6 to 7 migration\n\n- Convert the local echo and cache providers from Language Model V2 to V4, including the specification version, nested token usage, structured finish reasons, and stream events. Old cached AI SDK 6 responses are normalized when read.\n- Pass trusted system prompts through `instructions` in agent selection, generation, compaction, summaries, and titles. AI SDK 7 rejects system messages in `messages`.\n- Replace `stepCountIs` with `isStepCount` and consume the renamed `stream` property instead of `fullStream`.\n- Expose the synthetic echo provider for explicit `--model link-assistant/echo` runs, supply its model metadata, and select it when `--dry-run` has no explicit model.\n\n## Reproduction and pin exceptions\n\nBefore this change, `npm outdated` listed 59 stale direct declarations. The new AI SDK 7 compatibility test failed against the V2 echo/cache providers. The packed package installed with two peer warnings when the newest `solid-js` and `web-tree-sitter` were selected.\n\nOpenTUI 0.5.12 requires exact peer versions that are older than those packages' latest releases. `solid-js` remains at 1.9.12 until [OpenTUI #689](https://github.com/anomalyco/opentui/issues/689) is resolved. `web-tree-sitter` remains at 0.25.10 until [Agent #322](https://github.com/link-assistant/agent/issues/322) is resolved; OpenTUI confirmed that 0.26+ is currently unsupported. The pin URLs are recorded in `js/package.json` and validated by the freshness check.\n\nThe earlier Security run failed on the old lockfile's high severity `fast-uri` advisory ([run 36601797955](https://github.com/link-assistant/agent/actions/runs/36601797955), log lines 4047–4048). The updated lockfile passes `npm audit --package-lock-only --audit-level=high`; two low severity Babel findings remain through OpenTUI.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npm test`: 797 pass, 4 existing todo, 0 fail.\n- `bun test ./tests/integration/dry-run.js`: 20 pass, 0 fail.\n- `npm run check`, changeset validation, and `bun install --frozen-lockfile`: pass.\n- Packed package installed in a fresh Bun project without peer warnings.\n- `node ../scripts/check-npm-freshness.mjs`: pass with the two linked exceptions; `cargo outdated --root-deps-only --exit-code 1`: pass.\n- `cargo test --all-features`, `cargo fmt --all -- --check`, and `cargo clippy --all-targets --all-features`: pass.\n- `npm audit --package-lock-only --audit-level=high`: pass.\n- Hive Mind `--tool agent` command-shape smoke: one-shot and live `stream-json` CLI runs pass with the local package and synthetic echo model; Hive Mind's own JSON stream parser confirms the echoed assistant message and successful result.\n\n<!-- hive-mind:changes:start -->\n### Changes\n- 33 file(s) modified\n- 3566 line(s) added\n- 5556 line(s) removed\n- Files:\n  - `.github/workflows/dependency-freshness.yml`\n  - `.github/workflows/rust.yml`\n  - `experiments/issue-319/npm-outdated-baseline.json`\n  - `experiments/issue-319/opentui-web-tree-sitter-issue.md`\n  - `experiments/issue-319/rust_versions.py`\n  - `js/.changeset/dependency-refresh.md`\n  - `js/bun.lock`\n  - `js/experiments/issue-304-summary-rejection.mjs`\n  - `js/experiments/model-resolved-fake-provider.mjs`\n  - `js/package-lock.json`\n  - `js/package.json`\n  - `js/src/agent/agent.ts`\n  - `js/src/cli/input-queue.js`\n  - `js/src/cli/model-config.js`\n  - `js/src/provider/cache.ts`\n  - `js/src/provider/echo.ts`\n  - `js/src/provider/opencode-zen.ts`\n  - `js/src/provider/provider.ts`\n  - `js/src/session/compaction.ts`\n  - `js/src/session/processor.ts`\n  - `js/src/session/prompt.ts`\n  - `js/src/session/summary.ts`\n  - `js/tests/ai-sdk-7-compat.ts`\n  - `js/tests/ai-sdk-warnings.ts`\n  - `js/tests/integration/dry-run.js`\n  - `js/tests/integration/model-resolved-event.js`\n  - `rust/Cargo.lock`\n  - `rust/Cargo.toml`\n  - `rust/changelog.d/20260929_172500_dependency_refresh.md`\n  - `rust/src/id.rs`\n  - `scripts/check-npm-freshness.mjs`\n  - `scripts/package-info.mjs`\n  - `scripts/use-module.mjs`\n<!-- hive-mind:changes:end -->\n",
